        "product_summary": "KPU and microfiber upper: Stitched shaft panels and a dotted ankle patch give this winter style its layered profile.\nPlush lining: Grey plush is visible inside the opened boot, along the shaft and tongue area.\nMixed lace guides: Metal upper guides and lower webbing loops hold the crossed laces, with a rear pull loop at the collar.\nRubber outsole design: The actual underside shows deep block-shaped lugs beneath the contoured lower upper.\nWholesale colour-size options: Black and Yellow are offered in EU 39–48 for assortment planning.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
